values
  ('2885cb68-e113-5a5f-886e-9aa42e444c0e', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g4-theme-summary'), null, 'hard',
   $q$How are Jun's and Nadia's views of the crashes different?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Jun thinks the crashes are funny, while Nadia thinks they are boring.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"Nadia blames Jun for the crashes, while Jun blames the paper.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"Jun sees the crashes as failures, while Nadia sees them as clues.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Both of them think the crashes mean they should give up.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Jun sees the crashes as failures, while Nadia sees them as clues.$q$, $q$Jun calls the first crash "terrible" and crumples the plane, but Nadia says, "Maybe it can tell us something." No one blames anyone in the story, so the choice about Nadia blaming Jun is not supported.$q$, 'draft', '81088546-0e58-5854-a332-3c31b695fa21')
