   $q$Which theme do both historical fiction stories share?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Children long ago did not have time to go to school.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"Some skills are too difficult for young people to learn.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"reverses-meaning"},{"text":"Old machines were better than the ones we use today.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"With practice and patience, a hard skill can be mastered.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$With practice and patience, a hard skill can be mastered.$q$, $q$Samuel practices "each night" until his page has no mistakes, and Clara practices tapping until she can copy a whole message. Both succeed, so the skills are not too hard for them.$q$, 'draft', 'eeba8748-d89a-5e65-b50e-75779ef3a434')
