   $q$In both tales, what must the main character wait for?$q$, $q$[{"text":"A reward from the leader of a village.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"Better weather for a long journey.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"Food that needs more time to grow.","is_correct":true},{"text":"A friend who promised to come back.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"literal-reading"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Food that needs more time to grow.$q$, $q$The mangoes need two weeks to ripen, and the fish needs a year to grow big. The fish does ask Kwame to come back, but what he waits for is food, not a friend.$q$, 'draft', 'd6a69aac-0bba-5872-9324-113523ecba23')
